{
  "title": "Jovial Dense Portuguese Pork Stew",
  "description": "A hearty, garlicky Portuguese stew featuring rosemary and render-fat, cooked in a lotus-leaf wrap. This macrobiotic-friendly dish is perfect for a cold winter's night.",
  "cuisine": "Portuguese",
